  "translation": "Asa kumaw tɔ bɛɛ, a fanga bɛɛ, o bɛɛ min na a kɛ, ani duguw minnu a dilan — yala olu tɛ sɛbɛnna donw kumaw sɛbɛn kɔnɔ, min ye Yuda masakɛw jate-donw (kronikiw) ye wa? Dɔrɔn de, a kokɔrɔ waati na, a senw bɔna ⟨את⟩ ni ban.",
